### 測試與啟動

- 測試框架：Vitest；設定於 [`vitest.config.ts`](mdc:vitest.config.ts)、[`tests/setup.ts`](mdc:tests/setup.ts)
- 常見測試入口：`tests/*.test.ts`；整合驗證位於 `tests/validation/*`

### 重要測試檔案索引

- 併發控制：[`tests/concurrency-control.test.ts`](mdc:tests/concurrency-control.test.ts)、[`tests/concurrency-integration.test.ts`](mdc:tests/concurrency-integration.test.ts)
- DuckDB 合併：[`tests/merge-duckdb*.test.ts`](mdc:tests/merge-duckdb.test.ts)
- 安全性（合併工具）：[`tests/merge-tool-security.test.ts`](mdc:tests/merge-tool-security.test.ts)
- FTS 與時間範圍：[`tests/hybrid-search.test.ts`](mdc:tests/hybrid-search.test.ts)、[`tests/ipc-time-range.test.ts`](mdc:tests/ipc-time-range.test.ts)

### 執行建議

- 單一測試檔：以測試名稱或檔案過濾
- 慢測：優先檢查 DB I/O、鎖、與序列化成本

